Switch                  FF_Bathroom_Heating         "srv_bathroom"                <heating>              (FF_Bathroom, gHeater, gHeater_Z1)                            
Switch                  FF_Bathroom_Ignored         "Bathroom"                 <error>                   (FF_Bathroom, gHeaterIgnored)                  
